Wed Aug 26 15:19:51 UTC 2026 - Shresth Kumar Lal <shresthkumarlal@gmail.com> - 1.2.0

- Update to version 1.2.0 
  * Added new project scaffolding commands (new-project, new-c-project, new-exe-project).
  * Improved support for Windows and MinGW environments (import libraries, batch shell fallbacks).
  * Enhanced package management and bundle-install dependency resolution.
  * Improved test runner output with clearer error reporting for failing scripts.
  * Expanded C code generation (cgen) capabilities.
  * Adjusted update-pkgs to avoid reinstalling existing dependencies (PR #102).
  * Added 'jpm tasks' top-level subcommand (PR #67).
  * Added 'jpm show-config' top-level subcommand for debugging config.
  * Added ':no-core' config option to disable core in static binaries (PR #109).
 
- Modified:
  * jpm.spec

